  "subject": "The steep reference point: the pulpit rock over the Lysefjord, where the drawn surface falls 70 degrees across a chunk cell 9.85 m wide, a drop of 27 m. A height query on the wrong posting indices, or on the wrong diagonal of the quad, is invisible on level ground and costs part of that drop here: turning the diagonal moves the ground under the sixteen standpoints below by up to 3.45 m.",
